OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 27 APR
OL,4,G0930FEssential Classics
OL,5,     GGeorgia Mann plays the best in
OL,6,     Gclassical music, with discoveries
OL,7,     Gand surprises rubbing shoulders
OL,8,     Gwith familiar favourites.
OL,9,G1300FClassical Live
OL,10,     GLinton Stephens introduces an
OL,11,     Gafternoon of specially made
OL,12,     Grecordings, including a live
OL,13,     Gconcert from Wigmore Hall where
OL,14,     Gthe Consone Quartet perform Clara
OL,15,     GSchumann and Schubert.
OL,16,G1600FComposer of the Week: Saint-Saens
OL,17,     GDonald Macleod explores how
OL,18,     GCamille Saint-Saens's musical
OL,19,     Ginterests took hold in childhood,
OL,20,     Gshaped by whistling kettles,
OL,21,     Gbrassy orchestras, and at his
OL,22,     Gbeloved piano.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
