OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 27 APR
OL,4,G1700FIn Tune
OL,5,     GPetroc Trelawny welcomes members
OL,6,     Gor the Chineke! Chamber Ensemble
OL,7,     Gfor a live performance, and talks
OL,8,     Gto conductor Robert Ames about
OL,9,     Ghis upcoming projects.
OL,10,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,11,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,12,     Gsoundscape of classical music.
OL,13,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,14,     GSuperstar violinist Nicola
OL,15,     GBenedetti joins the Philharmonia
OL,16,     Gin Elgar's tender Violin
OL,17,     GConcerto, followed by an all-
OL,18,     GFrench second half with music by
OL,19,     GChaminade and Debussy.
