OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 27 APR
OL,4,G2145FThe Essay: The Death and Life of
OL,5,     FChristopher Marlowe
OL,6,     GJerry Brotton reveals the
OL,7,     Genduring influence of Marlowe on
OL,8,     GShakespeare.
OL,9,G2200FNight Tracks
OL,10,     GSara Mohr-Pietsch presents an
OL,11,     Gadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,12,     Gfor late-night listening, from
OL,13,     Gclassical to contemporary and
OL,14,     Geverything in between.
OL,15,G2330F'Round Midnight
OL,16,     GSoweto Kinch is back with another
OL,17,     Gweek of the best in jazz from the
OL,18,     GUK and around the world, and he
OL,19,     Gwelcomes bassist Rosa Brunello as
OL,20,     Ghis Flowers guest.
